  "notes": "LIGHT LANE (decided 2026-09-13, see plans/strategy v2): the closing electronic chapter before the songs. 2-track acid/italo pair. Date 2026-11-06 may slide one week to 2026-11-13 (Amir). STORES: Symphonic to DSPs, NO Beatport (write-once, files as Techno, irrelevant for the pop phase). Bandcamp + SoundCloud lossless + Amplify (mobile app). Spotify self-pitch with wave-leaning honest tags (Italo Disco / Acid House / Electro), Symphonic genre Electronic with a subgenre other than EBM Techno. CAMPAIGN: 2-3 reels, warm SC inbox contacts, curators who added Farewell/The Deceiver (darkwave/post-punk lists first, per the Spotify neighbourhood plan). CTA everywhere = FOLLOW on Spotify (Release Radar for the first song), not just stream. SKIP: label demos, DJ waves, Reddit ladder, premieres, Discovery Mode. HARD RULE: artwork + metadata 100% final at first submission. Masters: MIXING/DONE/A Liar MIX/EXPORT/Inch of Shadow - Pinocchio Master 1.5 @ 126bpm.wav (verify final version with Amir); 127 Jam in MIXING/Jam 127 F Minor Mix. Track 2 title pending from Amir.",
